{"id": "t030-003", "text": "Callum got made redundant on Friday. Eleven years there. He says he's fine but he really isn't. I should take him for a pint next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Callum", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Eleven years there", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him for a pint", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t030-004", "text": "Just got off the phone with Shanice. Her nan passed away on Sunday morning, peacefully apparently. Funeral is provisionally 3rd of June in Leeds. Her mum is doing all the arrangements and Shanice is worried about her coping. Need to send flowers to her mum's house and ask Shanice if she wants me to drive her up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nan", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "3rd of June", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send flowers to her mum's house", "owner": "r2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Shanice if she wants me to drive her up", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t030-005", "text": "Aarav and Laila are getting a puppy!! Cockapoo, collecting her June 3rd. Names shortlisted: Pickle or Mochi.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aarav", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laila", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting a puppy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Cockapoo", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t030-006", "text": "Hoang's cat Pho turned 15 today apparently. He made her a tuna cake lol", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hoang", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pho", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turned 15", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t030-007", "text": "Note: Yusuf's dad's bypass went ahead 5/14, he's in ICU for a couple of days then on the ward. Yusuf flying back from Dubai on the 17th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bypass", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5/14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in ICU", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back from Dubai", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 17th", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t030-008", "text": "Ask Kalani how her MRI went. It was Thursday I think", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Kalani how her MRI went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "MRI", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t030-009", "text": "Fiona and Rory split up. She moved out on the 2nd. Don't bring it up at Chloe's birthday drinks on Saturday", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fiona", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rory", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chloe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday drinks", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t030-010", "text": "kaito vet tmrw 9am for the rabbit, Mochi's teeth again. he can't take time off so I'm dropping her in for him", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "kaito", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "vet", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tmrw 9am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rabbit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t030-011", "text": "Darius said his mother-in-law is coming out of hospital on 21/10 after the hip replacement and she's moving in with them for six weeks while she recovers. He sounded knackered, he's also covering for his boss who's off sick, so it's all landing on him at once. Their kids are giving up the spare room. Remind me to drop off a lasagne or something that week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Darius", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mother-in-law", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming out of hospital", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "21/10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving in with them", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "while she recovers", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "knackered", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off a lasagne", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t030-012", "text": "Duc - hates hospitals, faints at needles. Has his blood test on 9/12, said he'd rather not talk about it", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates hospitals", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "faints at needles", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "blood test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "9/12", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t030-013", "text": "Sean's wedding is off. Him and Ioana broke up last month, he only told people this week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sean", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week"}]}
