{"id": "t030-015", "text": "Anya's cat Luna is really poorly, kidney stuff. Vet said they might have to make a decision by the weekend. Anya is in bits. Must call her Sunday evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Luna", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "make a decision", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in bits", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t030-016", "text": "Marcus starts chemo November 4th, every three weeks through to February if it goes to plan. He told me over coffee, very matter of fact about it. He wants people to treat him normally and not go quiet on him. Likes terrible puns and anything about Formula 1.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "chemo", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "November 4th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every three weeks through to February", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "matter of fact about it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants people to treat him normally and not go quiet on him", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "terrible puns", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Formula 1", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t030-017", "text": "Dictated: so Alana rang about her brother Theo, he came off his motorbike on the A road Saturday night, broken collarbone and some ribs, he's in Southmead and they think he'll be out by Wednesday. Alana's going down every evening. I should send something to the ward, maybe the F1 magazine he likes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "came off his motorbike", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "broken collarbone and some ribs", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Southmead", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Wednesday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send something to the ward", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "F1 magazine", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t030-018", "text": "Dmitri lost his job. Whole team let go on the 30th. Interview lined up for next Tuesday already though, with a fintech in Shoreditch", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dmitri", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lost his job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 30th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t030-019", "text": "Vera - allergic to lilies (cats too). Keep in mind for her mum's funeral flowers.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic to lilies (cats too)", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t030-020", "text": "Chen Gupta's colonoscopy is 26/11. His wife's taking him. Wish him luck the day before, he's dreading the prep", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chen Gupta", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "colonoscopy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "26/11", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Wish him luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading the prep", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t030-021", "text": "Ximena's parrot Coco is 30 next month! She's having a little party for it on Nov 8th, I'm invited. Coco likes sunflower seeds and swearing. Her partner Kaito built it a new perch for the occasion, apparently it took him three weekends and the bird ignores it completely.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ximena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "parrot Coco", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "30", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "little party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Nov 8th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kaito", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t030-022", "text": "kenji op went ok, home now. says the stitches itch like hell. physio starts 2nd of Nov", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "kenji", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "physio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2nd of Nov", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t030-023", "text": "Sofia said her uncle died over the weekend - she's not close to him but her dad's taking it really hard. Funeral's in Porto on 12/11, they fly out the 10th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "uncle", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not close to him", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "taking it really hard", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "12/11", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fly out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 10th", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t030-024", "text": "Sara's new kitten is called Bean. Black with one white paw. Already destroyed her curtains", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "new kitten is called Bean", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
