{"id": "t030-026", "text": "Dalia getting her gallbladder out 7th of December, keyhole. Off work for two weeks after. Her partner Rory's taking time off to look after her.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting her gallbladder out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "7th of December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "two weeks after", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rory", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t030-027", "text": "Jen texted, Callum's mum had a fall and is in hospital with a broken wrist. Not serious but she's 89. They're visiting Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Callum", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "broken wrist", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "89", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visiting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t030-028", "text": "Darius & Laila's dog Rocky got hit by a car last night. He's alive, vet kept him in, back leg pinned this morning. They're both shaken. Don't forget to message them tomorrow to see how he's doing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Darius", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laila", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Rocky", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hit by a car", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back leg pinned", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "shaken", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message them", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t030-029", "text": "Theo was let go from the agency, says it's a relief honestly. Wants to try freelance illustration, which he's been on about since uni. Has a portfolio review 3 Dec with a studio in Bristol and a meeting with an old client on the 10th. His girlfriend Chloe is a bit worried about money but backing him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "let go from the agency", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a relief", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Wants to try freelance illustration", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since uni"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "portfolio review", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 Dec", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "meeting with an old client", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 10th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chloe", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit worried about money", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t030-030", "text": "Yusuf - big Arsenal fan, does sourdough, has a staffy called Tank", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Arsenal", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "sourdough", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "staffy called Tank", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t030-031", "text": "Rachel Evans's mum's memorial is 22/11 at 2pm, the church on Mill Lane. I'm going with Fiona.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rachel Evans", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "memorial", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "22/11 at 2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fiona", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t030-032", "text": "Need to book the dentist for myself, been putting it off since August", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book the dentist", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since August"}]}
{"id": "t030-033", "text": "Shanice broke up with Marcus. Sounds like it'd been coming for a while. She's staying at her sister's for now. Text her this weekend, not before, she said she needs a few days", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t030-034", "text": "Ioana's grandad's 90th was meant to be December 3rd but they've called it off, he's back in hospital with pneumonia. Ioana's going over to Bucharest on the 1st to be with him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "December 3rd"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "pneumonia", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going over to Bucharest", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 1st", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t030-035", "text": "Aarav said the puppy cried every night for the first week, they've got her crate in the bedroom now. Vaccinations done on 10/10, can go on walks from next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aarav", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "puppy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night for the first week"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Vaccinations", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "10/10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "from next week"}]}
{"id": "t030-036", "text": "Kalani's results came back clear!!! Her oncologist appointment was this morning. Send her something to celebrate — she's been wanting that Le Creuset pan forever.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "oncologist appointment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send her something", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanting that Le Creuset pan", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t030-037", "text": "chloe's hamster died. she's 7 so it's a big deal. her mum Fiona is getting her a new one for her bday on 2/14", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "chloe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hamster", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "7", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fiona", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2/14", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t030-038", "text": "Sean's dad has his cataract op on the 3rd of next month. Sean's driving him, both eyes done a week apart.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sean", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cataract op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd of next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sean", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week apart", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t030-039", "text": "Spoke to Anya after the vet. They had to put Luna to sleep Monday. She was 17. Anya's taking a couple of days off work. Ask her round for dinner next week, maybe Thursday, and get a card for her and her partner Kenji.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the vet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "put Luna to sleep", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "couple of days off work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask her round for dinner", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card for her and her partner Kenji", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kenji", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t030-040", "text": "Hoang is on the waiting list for hip surgery, could be months. Says he's in pain most days now. Works from home Mondays and Fridays.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hoang", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in pain most days", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Works from home Mondays and Fridays", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t030-041", "text": "Dmitri's interview went really well, second round on Nov 6. He's nervous about the presentation part, has to present a case study to the whole board.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dmitri", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second round", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Nov 6", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t030-042", "text": "call the vet re: flea treatment, also ask about the cat's weight", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call the vet re: flea treatment", "action_type": "call", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask about the cat's weight", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t030-043", "text": "Kaito Sato - neighbour at no. 14. Wife Alana, two boys. Retired surgeon. Loves bonsai.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kaito Sato", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "neighbour at no. 14", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "two boys", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "Retired surgeon", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bonsai", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t030-044", "text": "Marcus says the chemo is knocking him flat, the third round got postponed to 25 November because his bloods were low. His sister Dalia is staying with him for now, she's taken unpaid leave and is sleeping on his sofa, which can't be great for her back. Remind me to ring him before the 25th, and maybe sort a food delivery.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "chemo", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "knocking him flat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "third round", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "to 25 November", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "unpaid leave", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the 25th", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort a food delivery", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t030-045", "text": "Ximena got made redundant 31/10. Packing up her desk this week. Seems upbeat, already talking about going travelling in January.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ximena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "31/10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "upbeat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going travelling", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t030-046", "text": "Rory's labrador Bramble is due to have pups any day now. He's set up a whelping box in the kitchen lol", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rory", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "labrador Bramble", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due to have pups", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "any day now", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t030-047", "text": "Dictation: Duc's grandma died Thursday, she was ninety four, he's flying to Hanoi for the funeral on the twentieth and won't be back until early December. His boss gave him compassionate leave. Remember to message him on the day of the funeral and ask if he needs anyone to water his plants while he's away.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandma", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Hanoi", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the twentieth", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "until early December", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "compassionate leave", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day of the funeral", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask if he needs anyone to water his plants", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "while he's away", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t030-048", "text": "Vera Mensah, met at Jen's. Vet nurse. Fosters greyhounds. Doesn't drink.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vera Mensah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Vet nurse", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Fosters greyhounds", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "Doesn't drink", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t030-049", "text": "Had a long catch up with Adriana. Her ex, Callum, is getting married in March and she found out on Instagram. She's mostly fine but it stung. She's started pottery on Wednesdays and is thinking about getting a cat, probably a rescue from the place her friend Vera volunteers at. Her birthday's 2nd of February, a nice glaze set or pottery tools would go down well.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adriana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "ex", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Callum", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "mostly fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "stung", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pottery", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesdays"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking about getting a cat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "friend", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vera", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "2nd of February", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "nice glaze set or pottery tools would go down well", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t030-050", "text": "Chen's daughter had her tonsils out yesterday, recovering ok, living on ice lollies. Chen said she's back at school on Monday hopefully.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had her tonsils out", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back at school", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t030-051", "text": "Sofia + Sara's anniversary 9/2, they got together the week after Sofia's dad's funeral so it's bittersweet for them", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "9/2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "bittersweet", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t030-052", "text": "Laila's mum had her stroke 3 weeks ago, now in rehab. Laila's going part time to help. Check in with her, she's not coping but won't say it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stroke", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 weeks ago", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in rehab", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going part time", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not coping", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
